 early significantly reduces my scoring potential, especially since I already have a kong which limits \"Fully Concealed Hand\" options; (3) The hand is too far from completion to justify committing to a melded hand strategy; (4) Keeping flexibility allows me to potentially draw better tiles to form a more valuable hand.\n\nAnswer: Pass"}
